From 168f850bcfdb1d8c1ff2cf939e77f2ef83c75069 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 14:41:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(setup): repoint setup to write per-skill dirs from
 canonical skills/
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Drop .claude/commands/ copy path; claude/cursor now skills-only
- bin/forge.js: rewrite dryRunSetup (per-skill listing), createAgentSkill
  (add agentKey param + codex early return), loadAndSetupClaudeCommands
  (skills-only — setup claude, return {})
- lib/commands/setup.js: extend needsWorkflowRuntimeAssets to include
  hasSkill so runtime scripts are still installed for skills-based agents
- Plugin JSONs: claude + cursor capabilities.commands → false, remove
  commands dirs, skills dir repointed to .claude/skills / .cursor/skills
- package.json: remove .claude/commands/ from published files array
- Tests: update plugin-catalog (commands false for claude/cursor, true for
  codex), setup-runtime-flags (.cursor/skills/, .claude/skills/plan/SKILL.md)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
